**SITE** (Satellite Instructional Television Experiment, 1975-76) beamed educational TV to 2,400 villages using NASA's ATS-6; **STEP** (1977-79) tested satellite telecommunication; **APPLE** (1981) was the first Indian communication satellite; the **IGMDP** (Integrated Guided Missile Development Programme, 1983) is a missile programme.

