Russia's **Luna-25** (August 2023), its first Moon mission in 47 years, **crashed** days before Chandrayaan-3 landed. The **Artemis Accords** (US-led, 2020) set rules for lunar exploration; **India signed them in June 2023**. Russia and China lead the rival International Lunar Research Station.

@q 13:51-53

