NASA's **Kepler** telescope (2009-2018) found thousands of **exoplanets** by watching stars dim as planets crossed them; its successor is **TESS**. **DAVINCI+** and **VERITAS** are NASA's planned **Venus** missions; ESA's EnVision and India's **Venus Orbiter Mission** (approved 2024) also target Venus.

