@trap
**Aryabhata (1975)** was launched from the USSR, **IRS-1A** from **Baikonur**. Order: **SLV → ASLV → PSLV → GSLV**; **SITE → STEP → APPLE → IGMDP**. **ISRO Satellite Centre is in Bengaluru**, not Sriharikota. Chandrayaan-3 made India the **4th** to soft-land. In **LUPEX** India builds the **lander**, Japan the rover. Cryogenic = **liquid H_{2} + liquid O_{2}**. A rocket carries **liquid** oxygen. The black box is **orange**.
@end

